---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Support | Where Horses Run"
  description="Optional support for Where Horses Run and how future tips will work."
>
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <p class="hero__eyebrow">Support</p>
    <h1 id="page-title">Support Where Horses Run</h1>
    <p class="hero__summary">Where Horses Run is a free information site. Optional tips may be enabled to support its continued operation.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section-grid" aria-label="Support policy">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Free information stays free</h2>
      <p>Calendar, racecourse, country, glossary, and official-source information is not placed behind a paid membership or subscription.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>What a tip means</h2>
      <p>A tip is an optional payment in appreciation for information and content already provided by Where Horses Run. It does not purchase a product, betting service, prediction, racecard, odds, prize, or preferential access.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>No wagering</h2>
      <p>Where Horses Run does not accept bets, transmit wagers, provide gambling accounts, or pay gambling winnings. Tips are unrelated to the outcome of any race.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Payment availability</h2>
      <p>Tip payments are not yet enabled. If enabled, the amount, currency, payment processor, and applicable policies will be shown before payment.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Payment questions</h2>
      <p>See the <a href="/refund/">Refund Policy</a>, <a href="/commercial-disclosure/">Commerce Disclosure</a>, and <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> pages.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
